e link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-b06491d5d86d1bd6END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e20f93b2a2186412END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_CRE_Book_HistoryOfBlood_02</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CRE_Book_HistoryOfBlood_02\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CRE_Book_HistoryOfBlood_02\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">671f9f91-dd5d-456f-8fdd-5e5b410a5e70</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:671f9f91-dd5d-456f-8fdd-5e5b410a5e70\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:671f9f91-dd5d-456f-8fdd-5e5b410a5e70\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Behind a locked door near the main entrance of the <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery\">Rosymorn Monastery</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;82&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;46</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This missal charts an expedition to find a lost relic called The Blood of Lathander.] \n</p><p><br>\nWhile mine eyes remain unscorched, we have made great progress in finding His lost Blood. After many suns of searching, I pen this entry as our gaze lies upon a <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Sharran</a> outpost, nestled among the valleys of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chionthar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chionthar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Chionthar\">Chionthar</a></span>. \n</p><p><br>\nWe know the Sharrans hold the Blood - they dropped a cargo trunk during transport one eve, and its lid slipped open. 'Twas only a moment, but my shining adherents, what a <i>moment</i> it was. The entire riverbank aflame with a soothing radiance - the same rosy light of a summer dawn. I could practically hear his morning song bouncing between the valley walls. We advance upon those heretic nightbringers at the first <a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">light of dawn</a> tomorrow and shall leave naught but ashes in our wake.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/His_Holy_Blood,_Vol._1,_Dawnmaster_Dovaer\" title=\"His Holy Blood, Vol. 1, Dawnmaster Dovaer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/His_Holy_Blood,_Vol._1,_Dawnmaster_Dovaer\" title=\"His Holy Blood, Vol. 1, Dawnmaster Dovaer\">His Holy Blood, Vol. 1, Dawnmaster Dovaer</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/His_Holy_Blood,_Vol._3,_Dawnmaster_Vaseid\" title=\"His Holy Blood, Vol. 3, Dawnmaster Vaseid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/